		(uuid "ddc63e10-2d35-461d-9e1e-b56e0c8f5e7f")
	)

	(text "FC1 and FC2 are separate boards with identical engines; POOL1 and POOL2 likewise.  S01 serialises the stages, so at most one engine of each pair is running at a time.\nThis sheet multiplexes each pair back onto the single FC_* / POOL_* slot that S11 was verified against: FC2_BUSY selects FC2 when high, and POOL2_BUSY selects POOL2 when high.\nA mux is required instead of an OR/AND merge because the engine 74HC138 region decoders are qualified only by MEM_nCE: an idle engine still drives a region code while another engine owns the bus.\nThe selected engine's region/REQ/WE/BUSY reach S11 unchanged; the unselected engine's outputs are simply ignored.  No engine sheet changes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0707a433-0e06-475c-8d9b-a0f87fba0c55")
	)

